  str_book_pet_tag_friend_40032 = "Fiendling",
  str_book_tag_faction_des_1 = "The city built on a floating island called Azurite is the center of civilization. With a powerful protective barrier, it is also the safest stronghold in the world. There is a strict hierarchy here; the Governor, the Elder Council from the Noble, and the Priests of the Temple, who together, govern a large number of civilians. Lumopolis sees itself as the protector of the Astral civilization, accustomed to dictating what goes on in the outside world. However, with the rise of the Illumina Federation, Lumopolis' high officials became alarmed.",
  str_book_tag_faction_des_2 = "Umbraton is a collection of towns beneath Azurite, and is also the most accessible location in Astra. It began as the slums of Lumopolis before evolving into a hub of commerce and trade. As its influence expanded and the population increased, Umbraton became autonomous. No longer under the authority of Lumopolis, Umbraton is now controlled by local guilds and major gangs.",
  str_book_tag_faction_des_3 = "With the huge undercity Gannon at the center connected with several nearby settlements, the military group formed a base to serve as the first line of defense against Eclipsite invasions. The military-first system was vigorously promoted, scientific research received heavy investment, education was made accessible for all, and a civil service system was established. At present, the Illumina Federation is committed to uniting factions to establish a unified and just governing body. With its continuous growth, the Illumina Federation is gradually branching away from Lumopolis...",
  str_book_tag_faction_des_4 = "Winter all year round and sparsely populated, the great snow-capped mountains to the north of the border were once the home of the Aurorian tribe. The remaining Aurorians there have thrived, calling themselves the people of the Northland. Even though the Northland Aurorians are a formidable force, they rarely involve themselves in Astral's affairs.",
  str_book_tag_faction_des_5 = "A disorderly and no-nonsense nomadic alliance made up of travelers, adventurers, and bounty hunters. Using righteousness as a criterion, those who are deemed worthy by the majority are elected as leaders. With a Lizard Colossus as the mobile base, they wander around the Rediesel Desert in their tattered vehicles, either pieced together or modified, living an unfettered, carefree life.",
  str_book_tag_faction_des_6 = "A secret society with a long history that has no fixed territory. Its fanatical and zealous members always lurked among Astral's cities, and wandered around indistinct gray zones, promoting their own ideas and philosophies. It is said that the True Order believes that the history and tomes made public by the Lumopolis Temple are false and that they are committed to unearthing the buried truth.",
  str_book_tag_faction_des_7 = "Across the vast continent, there are many small communities, unidentified organizations, and denizens of ancient ruins. Due to distance, their insistence on independence, or because they are already wandering nomads to begin with, they do not belong to any power within the Astral civilization at all. They are \"The Independent.\" Their appearance and clothing, way of life, and cultural customs vary. Some even remain unknown, such as the guards in certain ruins...",
  str_book_tag_faction_des_8 = "Eclipse is a multi-racial and multi-regional conspiracy organization whose core leader is rumored to be a powerful high-level Eclipsite. The organization is said to possess a wealth of mysterious knowledge and resources of unknown origins. It claims to be able to realize the ambitions and dreams of its members, and by using this as a bargaining chip to recruit rebels from various forces and races, it has attempted to launch one attack after another on the cities of Astra...",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_1 = "The most senior officers in the Illumina Federation are all generals. Each general commands a legion fighting against all enemies invading the Illumina Federation in open battles.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_2 = "Responsible for developing various support plans in the Illumina Federation, including intelligence, surveillance, logistics, transportation, and exploration; it is a necessary existence that ensures smooth military operation of the legion.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_3 = "The most important scientific institute of the Illumina Federation. Under the leadership of the genius scientist, Gronru, it's mainly responsible for the research on mechas, materials, biology, and psychology to maintain the Illumina Federation's leading edge in technology.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_4 = "The four knight commanders of Lumopolis, known as the Four Angels, performed outstanding feats in the battle against Eclipsites, representing the mighty force of Lumo Noble.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_5 = "Representing the power of the Lumopolis governor, it consists of members of the Schwartz family at its core, as well as factions formed by two Nightwatch Captains appointed by the governor himself as the henchmen. It is the power center of Lumopolis.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_6 = "The institution that maintains the law and order of Lumopolis. Not only does it include judicial experts, but also other officials that assist in verdicts and decision-making.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_7 = "Lumopolis' Academy Choir is led by the patient Lady Uriah. It features the famous Keating group accompanied by vocalist, Chloe, and is quite popular in Lumopolis.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_8 = "The most powerful gang in Umbraton is not only large in numbers but their leader, Istvan, has an intricate relationship with Lumopolis. His contacts and strength are unfathomable...",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_9 = "Umbraton's chaos gave rise to numerous gangs, both large and small. Unwilling to be bound to gangs, some powerful individuals struck out on their own, and those were the best of the best.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_10 = "A loose governing body consisting of the Queen of the North and four other supporting members. It's mainly responsible for making decisions on major events such as the survival of the Northland and the emergence of the Darkover Crisis.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_11 = "Based on the ancient documents found, they have wielded great power, thus believing that they are not far from the ultimate goal, and naturally, they become the leader of the many factions of the True Order.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_12 = "A squad formed by members who favor Suppressive Fire. Brock may not be a good marksman, but by virtue of his relationship with Jona, they work hand in hand, mainly handling incoming pestering enemies.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_13 = "As two singers of the same group, Regina and Barbara are secretly in competition due to different music theories, so concerts were often held, and that's how the Rediesel Wrench Music Festival came about.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_14 = "These make up the two main battle teams in Rediesel Wrench. The Canaries are responsible for disrupting the enemy's formation, while the Wild Turtledoves focus on attacking meanwhile. After a chaotic battle, they either win or retreat in time...",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_15 = "The loosely-structured small guild is composed of skilled couriers and guides, each of whom is responsible for delivery in an area. They maintain little contact with one another, knowing each other purely by identity.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_27 = "This newly-established biological laboratory of the Illumina Federation has made adequate progress under the leadership of research officer Migard. She has also recruited Jola, Benny and Curo, and Ansia to assist her in her work, placing them in charge of consultation, defense, and communication.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_28 = "Although they are each unique, these mercenaries, adventurers, and drifters all possess some animal characteristics and get along in harmony just like good friends should.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_29 = "After a heated conflict on a street corner, Tessa, Areia, and Sariel eventually became friends. Along with two members of the Spearows, Dayna and Robyn, they formed a loose alliance to continue their adventure together.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_30 = "Corax, Cuscuta, and Taki are the main members of Istvan's secret assassins alliance, and as Istvan's allies, they are exclusively responsible for providing emergency assistance. Generally speaking, they are only called upon when the gang is faced with a major threat.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_31 = "Once the Keeper of Windward Forest, Sylva recently formed a small team with Leah to take Alice on an adventure across the continent.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_32 = "Regardless of past tribulations, Red-Eye Gorge is a name they will never forget. Now that the storm has dissipated, a sea of snow-white flowers flourishes in full bloom, and a new day dawns on Red-Eye Gorge. This place has become the new home that they have vowed to protect for the rest of their lives.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_33 = "No one knows the former deeds of these four heroes—all that remains of their past in this age are scattered legends. Not even their real names are known, and the only thing certain of them is that they are mortal enemies of the Eclipsites...",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_34 = "Regardless of past tribulations, Red-Eye Gorge is a name they will never forget. Now that the storm has dissipated, a sea of snow-white flowers flourishes in full bloom, and a new day dawns on Red-Eye Gorge. This place has become the new home that they have vowed to protect for the rest of their lives.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_35 = "Many members in the Second Faction joined the True Order for different reasons, some even believing they're merely allies of the Order. However, they all have intricate connections to Victoria of the First Faction and with identical goals, as temporary as those might be...",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_36 = "The Guild Headquarters is an indispensable part of Umbraton, and without it, many of the city's commercial activities would fall into a more chaotic and disorderly state. To this end, the guild leader is always on the lookout for reliable mercenaries and allies to assume the responsibility of protecting it.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_37 = "As representatives of the Lumopolis nobility, they possess formidable combat skills and hold onto their faith with fierce conviction, always charging to the fore in the name of the light when battling against Eclipsites.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_38 = "The innumerable soldiers and officers of the Illumina Federation are responsible for holding the Dunefire Line, fighting on the front line in the war against Eclipsites with all their might. This is how it has always been, and will be for the foreseeable future.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_39 = "Five visitors from another world have come here for vacation. To them, the fierce battlefield is just extra holiday fun comparable to the kitchen.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_40 = "On Cloud Island, a sea away from Astra, a piece of scarlet red jade drew them into a fateful encounter that had them fighting as one, and when the dust settled, they became companions.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_41 = "Members of the Rediesel Wrench that spend most of their time out exploring and investigating don't have a strict chain of command to follow. They form groups mostly based on mutual interests to collect information on Ruins, trade routes and new strongholds.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_42 = "A treachorously bizarre play runs day and night in a mysterious theater. Its three actors escape from the grasp of the dark nursery rhymes with outside help, yet their lives have already been forever altered.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_43 = "A masked group from another world made up of youths with a special power called Persona. They steal only twisted desires.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_44 = "For those from Astra, the eastern continent of Longzhou is undoubtedly an exotic and mysterious land. Fate saw that merchant ship dock on the shores that day, henceforth changing the destiny of both its passengers from faraway Longzhou and the Astra locals on shore.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_45 = "The members of the Courier Union can be said to be \"migratory birds\" who fly around the continent of Astra, day after day. From the inland plains to the coastal cliffs, from the snowy mountains to the scorching desert, from remote villages to bustling cities—they never rest.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_46 = "Although they are all from Lumo Hall of Justice, they all have different understandings of the law. Therefore, the trial's process and outcome may be somewhat different from the others when it comes to the cases they are responsible for... Perhaps this is the influence of the gavel bearer.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_47 = "The past exists only in memories and will never return. The future exists only in expectations, but has yet to come. As the sun rises and the night fades away, the world rejoices at the coming of dawn and the promise of a brighter day. Thus, it can be seen that our hearts reside in the present, dictating the reality of our lives around us.",
  str_book_tag_friend_des_66 = "Ryza, the traveling alchemist from another world, and her companions form a squad of adventurers skilled in exploring various materials for alchemy synthesizing. Atelier Ryza is a fond memory they all share.",
  str_book_main_renshi = "Personnel Intel",
